# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Changes:
- Repeating background tasks now start a few ticks apart after loading instead of all on the same tick, spreading out server load
- Improved server performance of boss bars (player data is no longer read for every boss every second)

## Fixes:
- Theron's boss bar sharing its ID with Raj's, which made it get removed again every second
- message spam in log due to missing blockstate for summoned anvils in Rusta bossfight